# Mark frontend files used for GitHub Pages as vendored so GitHub Linguist
# excludes them from language statistics. This does NOT change any files,
# it only influences how GitHub computes repository language breakdown.

# All HTML files
*.html linguist-vendored

# All CSS files
*.css linguist-vendored

# All JavaScript files
*.js linguist-vendored

# Note: Python files are intentionally left unmarked so they count as Python.
